      "Primitive Defaults: Numeric primitives (byte, short, int, long) default to 0; float/double default to 0.0; char defaults to '\\u0000'; boolean defaults to false.",
      "Object Reference Defaults: Object arrays (e.g. String[], Integer[]) default to null for every element index."
