      "Syntax & Readability: Uses 'for (ElementType item : array)' to traverse elements without explicit array index variables.",
      "Compiler Desugaring: For arrays, javac transforms the enhanced for loop into a standard indexed loop (for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++)).",
      "Mutability Limitation: The loop iteration variable is a local copy of the element reference/value; reassigning it inside the loop body does NOT modify the original array array[i]."
