      "Safety Guarantee: Eliminates manual memory management defects such as double-free bugs, dangling pointer corruptions, and memory leaks.",
      "Garbage Collector Implementations: The JVM provides distinct GC algorithms optimized for latency or throughput (e.g., Serial, Parallel, G1, ZGC, Shenandoah)."
