      "Reduce Short-Lived Allocations: Avoid creating temporary throwaway objects inside tight loops; use StringBuilder for string concatenation.",
      "Match Initial & Max Heap Size: Set -Xms equal to -Xmx to eliminate expensive JVM heap expansion/resizing Stop-The-World pauses.",
      "Avoid System.gc(): Never invoke System.gc() in production application code.",
      "Select Appropriate Collector: Choose G1 GC for general web microservices or ZGC for low-latency financial systems requiring sub-millisecond STW pause bounds."
