      "Hardware Instruction Support: Uses atomic CPU memory bus locks or lock-free Compare-And-Swap (CAS) instructions (cmpxchg).",
      "Atomic Primitives: Classes like AtomicInteger, AtomicBoolean, and AtomicReference provide atomic read-modify-write methods (incrementAndGet, compareAndSet)."
