    "properAnswer": "**Kubernetes Liveness and Readiness Probes in Spring Boot**:\n\n1) **Spring Boot `application.yml` Configuration**:\n```yaml\nmanagement:\n  health:\n    probes:\n      enabled: true\n  endpoint:\n    health:\n      show-details: always\n```\n2) **Kubernetes Deployment Manifest**:\n```yaml\nlivenessProbe:\n  httpGet:\n    path: /actuator/health/liveness\n    port: 8080\n  initialDelaySeconds: 20\nreadinessProbe:\n  httpGet:\n    path: /actuator/health/readiness\n    port: 8080\n  initialDelaySeconds: 10\n```\n3) **Programmatically Updating State**:\n```java\n@Autowired\nprivate ApplicationEventPublisher eventPublisher;\n\npublic void onDatabaseFailure() {\n    // Temporarily stop traffic without restarting container\n    AvailabilityChangeEvent.publish(eventPublisher, this, ReadinessState.REFUSING_TRAFFIC);\n}\n```"
