      "JDK Examples: `Integer.valueOf(int)` caches values between -128 and 127; `String.intern()` reuses string literal instances in String Pool.",
      "Memory Savings: Reduces JVM heap allocation from gigabytes to megabytes when rendering millions of game entities or document characters."
