    "properAnswer": "**Flyweight Pattern Implementation**:\n\n```java\n// Shared Intrinsic Flyweight (Tree Type details shared by 1,000,000 trees in a game)\npublic record TreeType(String name, String color, String texture) {\n    public void draw(int x, int y) { // Extrinsic state (x, y) passed dynamically\n        System.out.println(\"Drawing \" + name + \" at (\" + x + \",\" + y + \")\");\n    }\n}\n\n// Flyweight Factory Caching Shared Instances\npublic class TreeFactory {\n    private static final Map<String, TreeType> treeTypes = new HashMap<>();\n    \n    public static TreeType getTreeType(String name, String color, String texture) {\n        return treeTypes.computeIfAbsent(name, n -> new TreeType(name, color, texture));\n    }\n}\n```"
