    "properAnswer": "**Producer-Consumer with `ArrayBlockingQueue`**:\n\n```java\npublic class ProducerConsumerDemo {\n    private static final BlockingQueue<String> queue = new ArrayBlockingQueue<>(10);\n    private static final String POISON_PILL = \"STOP\";\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {\n        Thread producer = new Thread(() -> {\n            try {\n                for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) queue.put(\"Event-\" + i);\n                queue.put(POISON_PILL); // Signal consumer shutdown\n            } catch (InterruptedException e) { Thread.currentThread().interrupt(); }\n        });\n\n        Thread consumer = new Thread(() -> {\n            try {\n                while (true) {\n                    String msg = queue.take(); // Blocks until data available\n                    if (POISON_PILL.equals(msg)) break; // Graceful exit\n                    System.out.println(\"Consumed: \" + msg);\n                }\n            } catch (InterruptedException e) { Thread.currentThread().interrupt(); }\n        });\n\n        producer.start(); consumer.start();\n        producer.join(); consumer.join();\n    }\n}\n```"
