    "properAnswer": "**Single-Pass Second Largest Element Algorithm**:\n\n```java\npublic class SecondLargest {\n    public static int findSecondLargest(int[] nums) {\n        if (nums == null || nums.length < 2) return -1; // Edge case\n        int first = Integer.MIN_VALUE;\n        int second = Integer.MIN_VALUE;\n\n        for (int num : nums) {\n            if (num > first) {\n                second = first;\n                first = num;\n            } else if (num > second && num != first) {\n                second = num; // Update second largest only if distinct\n            }\n        }\n        return (second == Integer.MIN_VALUE) ? -1 : second;\n    }\n}\n```"
