    "properAnswer": "**$O(N)$ Time & $O(1)$ Space Anagram Checker**:\n\n```java\npublic class AnagramChecker {\n    public boolean isAnagram(String s, String t) {\n        if (s.length() != t.length()) return false;\n        int[] count = new int[26];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {\n            count[s.charAt(i) - 'a']++;\n            count[t.charAt(i) - 'a']--;\n        }\n\n        for (int c : count) {\n            if (c != 0) return false; // Non-zero means frequency mismatch\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n}\n```"
