    "properAnswer": "**Dijkstra Shortest Path Implementation ($O((E + V) \\log V)$ Time)**:\n\n```java\npublic class DijkstraAlgorithm {\n    private record Edge(int target, int weight) {}\n\n    public int[] shortestPath(int V, List<List<Edge>> adj, int src) {\n        int[] dist = new int[V];\n        Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE);\n        dist[src] = 0;\n\n        // Min-Heap sorting by accumulated path distance\n        PriorityQueue<int[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Comparator.comparingInt(a -> a[1]));\n        pq.offer(new int[]{src, 0});\n\n        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n            int[] curr = pq.poll();\n            int u = curr[0], d = curr[1];\n            if (d > dist[u]) continue;\n\n            for (Edge edge : adj.get(u)) {\n                if (dist[u] + edge.weight < dist[edge.target]) { // Edge Relaxation\n                    dist[edge.target] = dist[u] + edge.weight;\n                    pq.offer(new int[]{edge.target, dist[edge.target]});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return dist;\n    }\n}\n```"
