    "properAnswer": "**Cycle Detection in Undirected Graph (DFS with Parent Tracking)**:\n\n```java\npublic class UndirectedCycle {\n    public boolean hasCycle(int V, List<List<Integer>> adj) {\n        boolean[] visited = new boolean[V];\n        for (int i = 0; i < V; i++) {\n            if (!visited[i]) {\n                if (dfs(i, -1, visited, adj)) return true;\n            }\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    private boolean dfs(int node, int parent, boolean[] visited, List<List<Integer>> adj) {\n        visited[node] = true;\n        for (int neighbor : adj.get(node)) {\n            if (!visited[neighbor]) {\n                if (dfs(neighbor, node, visited, adj)) return true;\n            } else if (neighbor != parent) {\n                return true; // Visited neighbor is NOT parent -> Cycle detected!\n            }\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n}\n```"
