    "properAnswer": "**0/1 Knapsack 1D DP Solution ($O(N \\times W)$ Time, $O(W)$ Space)**:\n\n```java\npublic class Knapsack01 {\n    public int knapsack(int W, int[] wt, int[] val, int n) {\n        int[] dp = new int[W + 1];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            // Traverse weight capacity BACKWARDS to enforce 0/1 item constraint!\n            for (int w = W; w >= wt[i]; w--) {\n                dp[w] = Math.max(dp[w], val[i] + dp[w - wt[i]]);\n            }\n        }\n        return dp[W]; // Max value at capacity W\n    }\n}\n```"
