    "properAnswer": "**Longest Common Subsequence DP Implementation ($O(M \\times N)$ Time)**:\n\n```java\npublic class LongestCommonSubsequence {\n    public int longestCommonSubsequence(String text1, String text2) {\n        int m = text1.length(), n = text2.length();\n        int[][] dp = new int[m + 1][n + 1];\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\n                if (text1.charAt(i - 1) == text2.charAt(j - 1)) {\n                    dp[i][j] = 1 + dp[i - 1][j - 1]; // Extend common match\n                } else {\n                    dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]); // Take best subproblem\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return dp[m][n];\n    }\n}\n```"
