    "properAnswer": "**$O(N \\log N)$ Patience Sort LIS Implementation**:\n\n```java\npublic class LongestIncreasingSubsequence {\n    public int lengthOfLIS(int[] nums) {\n        int[] tails = new int[nums.length];\n        int len = 0;\n\n        for (int x : nums) {\n            int i = 0, j = len;\n            // Binary Search for insertion index of x in tails array\n            while (i < j) {\n                int mid = i + (j - i) / 2;\n                if (tails[mid] < x) i = mid + 1;\n                else j = mid;\n            }\n            tails[i] = x;\n            if (i == len) len++; // Extended LIS length\n        }\n        return len;\n    }\n}\n```"
