    "properAnswer": "**House Robber 2-Variable DP Solution ($O(N)$ Time, $O(1)$ Space)**:\n\n```java\npublic class HouseRobber {\n    public int rob(int[] nums) {\n        if (nums == null || nums.length == 0) return 0;\n        int prev2 = 0; // Max money 2 steps back\n        int prev1 = 0; // Max money 1 step back\n\n        for (int num : nums) {\n            int curr = Math.max(prev1, prev2 + num);\n            prev2 = prev1;\n            prev1 = curr;\n        }\n        return prev1;\n    }\n}\n```"
