    "prompt": "202. What is a deadlock?",
    "answer": "Deadlock occurs when two or more threads are blocked forever, each waiting for the other to release a lock.\n\n\u2022 Deadlock happens when threads hold locks and wait for others.\n\u2022 It results in program hang.\n\u2022 Prevention: Avoid nested locks or use timeouts.",
